<title>USA: Federal Realty sells 1.6 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Federal Realty sells 1.6 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Realty Investment Trust said an offering of 1.6 million of its common shares was priced at 27-7/8 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds of the offering to pay down debt, mainly the company's credit facilities.</p>
<p>Alex. Brown &amp; Sons was the offering's underwriter, the company said.</p>
<p>As a result of the offering, the company will have about 36 million common shares outstanding.  It had 34.236 million at the end of its third-quarter, which closed September 30.</p>
</text>
